Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash prompt routing for backend
 commands

Slash commands typed from the colon prompt while an agent chat is selected enter the same chat-submit path as insert-mode agent chat, so provider-specific commands such as Codex slash commands reach the selected backend session instead of the command surface.
